blendOS             is                                                                                                                                        an            Arch                     Linux-based,     rolling-release   distribution      which         automates      installing       software      from           supported            distributions  (Arch,        Fedora,        and              Ubuntu)        into           containers.   blendOS       tries               to            make                software           management           in             across           containers    feel          native            and              provides      access         to              the              user's       home          directory     for           each                 container.     blendos                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
